{"id":"msg_m_ex_mightytools_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_mightytools","label":"Mighty Tools · Group"},"label":"2. Liter! Boss! We got a complaint!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_mightytools_01","next":"msg_m_event_fullfoolday_04","speakers":{"centi":"Centi","liter":"Liter"},"icons":{"centi":"si_c080_00_s","liter":"si_c082_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_1","text":"Liter! Boss! We got a complaint!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_2","text":"Complaint?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_3","text":"What complainnt？","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_4","text":"Complainnt？","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_5","text":"That's rude, Greenhorn.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_6","text":"Say it agaain.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_7","text":"I wonder what kind of","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_8","text":"complaint we got.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_9","text":"But I think I can","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_10","text":"guess what it's for.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_11","text":"It must be a complaint about the construction noise.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_12","text":"It's not that!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_13","text":"It's not?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_14","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_15","text":"Then what is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_16","text":"Tellll meeeeee!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_17","text":"Fine, fine!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_18","text":"Someone was at one of our construction sites","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_19","text":"and ended up discovering some skeletal remains.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_20","text":"Once we're finished here, we've got to go help identify who they possibly belong to.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_21","text":"Bones?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_22","text":"I didn't see that coming.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_23","text":"I'm not quite sure how to react...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_24","text":"I didn't expect things to take such a morbid turn.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_25","text":"Huh?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_26","text":"There are pictures!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_27","text":"These bones are much bigger than I imagined.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_28","text":"They look like human bones.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_29","text":"Human bones?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_30","text":"Yeah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_31","text":"I have no idea how they could have gotten there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_32","text":"If that's the case, then we have to call the police for sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_33","text":"Myy thoughs exactly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_34","text":"All right then,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_35","text":"Centi,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_36","text":"call the police at once.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_37","text":"Ah! Liter!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_38","text":"Wha t ?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_39","text":"I checked the photos again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_40","text":"I think these bones... are actually Volt's treats.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_41","text":"What? But how?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_42","text":"Actually, that would explain why I ran out of treats so quickly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_43","text":"Volt must have knocked them over at the construction site when we were working there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_44","text":"Bad boy, Volt!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_45","text":"No more bone-shaped treats for you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mightytools_02_46","text":"At least they're not human bones.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mightytools_02_47","type":